{:edb/committed true :edb/basis-t 2066 :edb/replayed false :edb/tx-hash "efaab76744706bef4be9ddffc148db7322c48e9753b541009320509c571867e3" :edb/db-before-t 2065 :edb/db-after-t 2066 :edb/tx-data [[13194139535378 50 #inst "2026-10-08T23:05:53.696Z" 13194139535378 true] [17592186087677 1020 #edb/ref 17592186346647 13194139535378 true] [17592186087677 1020 #edb/ref 17592186346650 13194139535378 true] [17592186087678 1020 #edb/ref 17592186346633 13194139535378 true] [17592186087678 1020 #edb/ref 17592186346640 13194139535378 true] [17592186088372 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139535378 true] [17592186088372 1100 "Find the asymptotes of the hyperbola $\\frac{y^{2}}{18} - \\frac{x^{2}}{81} = 1$." 13194139535378 false] [17592186088372 1100 "Find the asymptotes of the hyperbola $\\frac{{y}^{2}}{18}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{81}=1.$" 13194139535378 true] [17592186088372 1145 "The standard equation of a vertical hyperbola centered at the origin is\n\n$$\n\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\nFor a vertical hyperbola centered at the origin, the equations of the asymptotes are\n\n$$\ny=\\pm \\frac{a}{b}x.\n$$\n\nIn our case, we have \n\n$$\na=\\sqrt{18}=3\\sqrt{2},\\,b=\\sqrt{81}=9.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the asymptotes of the hyperbola are\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =\\pm \\frac{3\\sqrt{2}}{9}x \\\\  & =\\pm \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{3}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535378 true] [17592186346633 1017 #edb/ref 17592186346634 13194139535378 true] [17592186346633 1089 "q-10435" 13194139535378 true] [17592186346633 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535378 true] [17592186346633 1100 "Find the asymptotes of the hyperbola ${y}^{2}-9{x}^{2}=9.$" 13194139535378 true] [17592186346633 1113 #uuid "07129d8d-82e3-5b90-a321-b803049449ab" 13194139535378 true] [17592186346633 1145 "The standard equation of a vertical hyperbola centered at the origin is\n\n$$\n\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\nFor a vertical hyperbola centered at the origin, the equations of the asymptotes are\n\n$$\ny=\\pm \\frac{a}{b}x.\n$$\n\nTo rewrite the given equation in standard form, we divide both sides of the equation by $9$ and then simplify, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}^{2}-9{x}^{2} & =9 \\\\ \\frac{{y}^{2}}{9}-\\frac{9{x}^{2}}{9} & =\\frac{9}{9} \\\\ \\frac{{y}^{2}}{9}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{1} & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we have $a=\\sqrt{9}=3$ and $b=\\sqrt{1}=1.$\n\nTherefore, the asymptotes of the hyperbola are\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =\\pm \\frac{3}{1}x \\\\  & =\\pm 3x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535378 true] [17592186346634 1000 #edb/ref 17592186346635 13194139535378 true] [17592186346634 1000 #edb/ref 17592186346636 13194139535378 true] [17592186346634 1000 #edb/ref 17592186346637 13194139535378 true] [17592186346634 1000 #edb/ref 17592186346638 13194139535378 true] [17592186346634 1000 #edb/ref 17592186346639 13194139535378 true] [17592186346634 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535378 true] [17592186346634 1041 "selection" 13194139535378 true] [17592186346634 1104 #edb/ref 17592186346638 13194139535378 true] [17592186346634 1110 #uuid "a29831a1-e7e3-5246-82d0-04c451b30b78" 13194139535378 true] [17592186346635 1034 "y=\\pm 2x" 13194139535378 true] [17592186346635 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535378 true] [17592186346635 1111 #uuid "02704357-d1ba-5c57-a0cd-dbc02e66834a" 13194139535378 true] [17592186346636 1034 "y=\\pm \\frac{1}{2}x" 13194139535378 true] [17592186346636 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535378 true] [17592186346636 1111 #uuid "b7a21051-369e-586e-b427-e4044d179a9f" 13194139535378 true] [17592186346637 1034 "y=\\pm x" 13194139535378 true] [17592186346637 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535378 true] [17592186346637 1111 #uuid "c360cb14-778e-56b7-84bf-80bbac8ba868" 13194139535378 true] [17592186346638 1034 "y=\\pm 3x" 13194139535378 true] [17592186346638 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535378 true] [17592186346638 1111 #uuid "e774533f-4408-554e-b611-6b0d65543b38" 13194139535378 true] [17592186